{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/7261d21367f39a6955979ef83bd40da3.webp?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/fc1ae33efe6ff75585cacfc2924ca414.poster.avif?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/fc1ae33efe6ff75585cacfc2924ca414.webm?t=1748238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to be swept away by the captivating tale of Waltz, a pure and innocent soul, accompanied by the lovable puppy spirit, Jam! Together, they embark on a thrilling quest through 7 formidable trials through 7 unique locations, each one a crucial step towards determining Waltz's destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/4d11e35720564e9db178a2773cdc043c.poster.avif?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/4d11e35720564e9db178a2773cdc043c.webm?t=1748238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S DANGEROUS TO ADVENTURE ALONE... TAKE A PUPPY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jam is cute and lovable. But that's not all! As you journey together, Jam will discover new and incredible abilities that he possesses. Fight daring battles, locate lost secrets, and uncover hidden paths that Waltz couldn't reach alone.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/9801b9388476e18b6e15f330ef10627d.poster.avif?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/9801b9388476e18b6e15f330ef10627d.webm?t=1748238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER A TREASURE TROVE OF TOYS ON YOUR ADVENTURE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left behind by legendary toy craftsmen, use these terrific trinkets to solve puzzles, defeat monsters, and traverse the world in fun and exciting ways. Cut, push, leap, and knock out any obstacle in Waltz's way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/be317d289455b0ef0f64532350b391d4.poster.avif?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/be317d289455b0ef0f64532350b391d4.webm?t=1748238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE 7 UNIQUE REALMS TO SAVE WALTZ'S SOUL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture as a destiny-bound duo through immersive realms inspired by the seven deadly sins! Each area pulses with its own distinct personality, teeming with untold secrets and thrilling surprises waiting to be unearthed. Overcome dangerous trials and collect soul-bound stamps to send Waltz onto their final destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/1c79a025f233edf221f3540947ec8f49.poster.avif?t=1748238752\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/1c79a025f233edf221f3540947ec8f49.webm?t=1748238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIN HEART-POUNDING BOSS BATTLES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End each tough trial with a battle against a colossal opponent. Gather up every skill and helpful toy that Waltz and Jam have at their disposal, figure out the Boss's attack patterns, and find the perfect moment to strike as a team. Check out our Community page as there are a few secret Bosses scattered throughout the world. Can Waltz and Jam find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extra